desc: Rosalina Curiosa Harpsichords (VCSL port) by chmaha
tags: instrument sampled
author: chmaha
version: 1.1
changelog:
  Add full copyright and licence header (upstream authors' notices).
about:
  Five harpsichords: English (normal and lute stop), Flemish (4', 8' and full), French, Italian and
  one by an unknown maker, with key-release samples.
  One instrument at a time, with its articulations on keyswitches.
  Samples load on demand, only for instruments in use.
  Ported from sfizz 1.2.3 (sfizz authors, https://sfz.tools/sfizz, BSD 2-clause).
  Samples: Versilian Community Sample Library (VCSL) 1.2.2 by Versilian Studios and contributors, CC0 1.0
  (https://github.com/sgossner/VCSL), with SFZ mappings by Peter Eastman (public domain). Rounded to 16 bits and
  joined into one FLAC per instrument (Dependencies/RosalinaCuriosa/RosalinaCuriosaHarpsichords-LICENSE.txt).
  JSFX code released under GPLv3+ license
  Claude generated some of this code
provides:
  Dependencies/RosalinaCuriosa/Harpsichords.txt
  Dependencies/RosalinaCuriosa/HarpsichordEnglish.flac
  Dependencies/RosalinaCuriosa/HarpsichordFlemish.flac
  Dependencies/RosalinaCuriosa/HarpsichordFrench.flac
  Dependencies/RosalinaCuriosa/HarpsichordItalian.flac
  Dependencies/RosalinaCuriosa/HarpsichordUnknown.flac
  Dependencies/RosalinaCuriosa/RosalinaCuriosaHarpsichords-LICENSE.txt
